###PROJECT REPORT

##College Event Management System

#1. Introduction
The College Event Management System is a Java based project that helps in managing information regarding basic college events. The user can perform operations such as adding new events, displaying all events and searching for a specific event.
The project has been developed in a simple console-based system so that it is easily comprehensible.

#2. Problem Statement
It becomes very difficult to manage event information manually especially when there are many events. It becomes very difficult to manage event name, venue, date and capacity.

In this project, an easy way has been provided to store and manage event information with the help of a Java based program.

#3. Objectives
The objectives of this project are as follows:

Add new college events.
Display all events.
Search for an event.
Store information about events while executing the program.
Practice basic programming concepts in Java.

#4. Technologies Used
Programming Language: Java
Data Structure: ArrayList
Input: Scanner
Platform: Java JDK
Interface: Command Line / Console

#5. Features
Following features are provided in the project:
Add Event
User can enter event ID, event name, venue, date and capacity.
View Events
User can view details of all the events entered.
Search Event
User can search for any event using event name.
Exit

User can exit from the program using Exit command.

