#8. Operation of the Project

On launching the program, the menu appears.

College Event Management

1. Add Event
2. View Events
3. Search Event
4. Exit

The user selects an option.

For instance, when Add Event option is selected, the program prompts to enter:

Event ID
Event Name
Venue
Date
Capacity

The entered event will be saved in the ArrayList.

On selecting View Events option, the saved events are shown on the screen.

Selecting Search Event will make the program look for event names and display the matched event.

