#10. Benefits
Easy to use.
Simple to understand.
Helps in avoiding manual event management.
Offers fast event search.
Based on basic concepts of Java.
Applicable for small college event management system.

#11. Limitations
The application runs via the console.
Data is stored while the application is running.
Data is lost once the application is closed.
It does not have user login at the moment.
There is no permanent database at the moment.

#12. Future Scope
The application can be enhanced in the future by incorporating the following features:

